From: Joan Torres Lopez <joantolo@redhat.com>
Date: Mon, 20 Oct 2025 17:24:40 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 31/73] loginDialog: Vertically center authPrompt using fixed
 height

Use a fixed estimated height for centering so the position stays
stable regardless of actual content height changes during user
interaction.

Part-of: <https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/gnome-shell/-/merge_requests/4306>
---
 js/gdm/loginDialog.js | 25 ++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 24 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

