Subject: [PATCH 65/73] gdm/authServicesSSSDSwitchable: Implement intelligent
 cancel handling

Override cancelRequested() to handle Escape/cancel based on the current
prompt state. Track the active prompt with a PromptStatus enum set at
each signal emission, enabling context-aware cancel behavior: stepping
back to a previous prompt when appropriate (without SSSD round-trips),
soft reset when needed, or falling back to the default hard reset.

Co-authored-by: Joan Torres Lopez <joantolo@redhat.com>
Part-of: <https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/gnome-shell/-/merge_requests/3212>
---
